WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.490
OP sequence

00:00:01.110 --> 00:00:10.820
Request from Ichigo... when watching the television, sit a safe distance from the television in a well-lit room.

00:00:12.080 --> 00:00:16.860
closed captions

00:00:12.890 --> 00:00:15.690
I see. She's on duty today.

00:00:16.020 --> 00:00:17.730
I should get up...

00:00:21.830 --> 00:00:23.400
Vanilla, it's morning.

00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:27.630
Morning, Ichigo.

00:00:32.640 --> 00:00:34.760
Why did the clock stop!?

00:00:34.760 --> 00:00:36.180
Sorry!

00:00:36.510 --> 00:00:39.420
But, if we go now, we won't be late for lessons at all.

00:00:39.420 --> 00:00:42.190
That's not it! The school's cafe and shops would be closed already.

00:00:42.680 --> 00:00:44.660
Oh that's a serious problem.

00:00:42.680 --> 00:00:44.660
Oh no... I have to run!

00:00:44.660 --> 00:00:46.100
It's totally impossible!

00:00:50.200 --> 00:00:51.810
What are you doing, Amano-san!?

00:00:51.810 --> 00:00:54.820
Ah, dorm supervisor. Good morning.

00:00:54.820 --> 00:00:58.990
Not "Good morning", how many times have you fell down the stairs?

00:00:59.910 --> 00:01:00.830
Sorry.

00:01:00.830 --> 00:01:02.000
Don't run in the hallway.

00:01:02.220 --> 00:01:02.950
Yes.

00:01:02.950 --> 00:01:06.200
In the first place, this happens because you woke up late.

00:01:05.290 --> 00:01:08.870
The start of her ranting... It's going to be long...

00:01:06.200 --> 00:01:08.870
Go to sleep early so that you can wake up early.

00:01:08.870 --> 00:01:10.340
Are you listening, Amano-san!?

00:01:10.340 --> 00:01:11.540
Yes, I'm listening.

00:01:12.070 --> 00:01:15.890
I won't run anymore, I won't. So, I'll be heading for the school cafe!

00:01:12.720 --> 00:01:15.890
Ichigo, let's go. Hurry, hurry.

00:01:15.890 --> 00:01:17.220
It's already closed.

00:01:17.220 --> 00:01:19.730
No way...

00:01:19.730 --> 00:01:21.890
I'm not getting my breakfast today too...

00:01:21.890 --> 00:01:23.730
Vanilla's stomach is grumbling...

00:01:23.730 --> 00:01:26.750
It can't be helped then, please wait a bit.

00:01:28.330 --> 00:01:30.090
I'm hungry...

00:01:30.090 --> 00:01:31.340
Me too...

00:01:33.620 --> 00:01:36.770
Here, you can eat this during recess.

00:01:36.770 --> 00:01:39.300
Oh, is it really okay?

00:01:39.300 --> 00:01:40.890
Hurry up and go.

00:01:40.890 --> 00:01:42.180
Thank you very much.

00:01:42.180 --> 00:01:43.670
So, I'll be going.

00:01:43.670 --> 00:01:44.950
Be careful!

00:01:45.290 --> 00:01:46.960
Yes, yes!

00:01:50.800 --> 00:01:51.960
Seriously...

00:01:53.490 --> 00:01:56.920
I'm okay, I'm used to it...

