00:03:37.870 --> 00:03:39.580
Hey, where's Amano-san?

00:03:39.580 --> 00:03:40.950
Is that idiot late!?

00:03:40.950 --> 00:03:43.120
I'm sorry! I'm late!

00:03:45.590 --> 00:03:47.480
You made it in time, Ichigo-chan.

00:03:47.480 --> 00:03:49.910
I barely made it.

00:03:49.910 --> 00:03:51.510
Overslept?

00:03:51.510 --> 00:03:53.540
No, I had some troubles...

00:03:53.540 --> 00:03:56.250
Eh? Today's lesson is on Bahmkufen, isn't it?

00:03:56.250 --> 00:03:57.470
Baumkuchen!

00:04:00.690 --> 00:04:06.700
recipe 22

00:04:00.690 --> 00:04:06.700
The Promised Perfect Sweets

00:04:06.950 --> 00:04:09.500
Huh? Aren't you going to use the frying pan?

00:04:09.500 --> 00:04:10.690
Or should we use the oven?

00:04:11.040 --> 00:04:15.190
Look here, you should have at least reviewed on how to make Baumkuchen...

00:04:15.550 --> 00:04:17.390
Ah, yes. But...

00:04:17.680 --> 00:04:20.360
So, look forward to learning how to make it.

00:04:20.740 --> 00:04:22.880
First, let's start with the batter.

00:04:43.010 --> 00:04:45.390
Okay! Now the batter is done.

00:04:49.110 --> 00:04:53.390
Oh, so this machine is actually an oven specifically for making Baumkuchen.

00:04:53.780 --> 00:04:55.610
We'll pour the batter in here.

00:04:55.890 --> 00:05:00.200
After that, we'll pour the batter onto the spit while rotating it slowly.

00:05:02.700 --> 00:05:04.910
Looks interesting! Let me do it too!

00:05:05.440 --> 00:05:08.410
You can pour in another layer only after the surface has been baked through.

00:05:08.730 --> 00:05:09.790
Okay!

00:05:09.790 --> 00:05:13.930
You will have to repeat this many times, so that you can get the reminiscent of tree growth rings.

00:05:13.930 --> 00:05:15.130
Okay, okay.

00:05:15.130 --> 00:05:20.420
Baumkuchen is a german name, and it has the meaning of "tree plus cake".

00:05:23.470 --> 00:05:26.000
I haven't had breakfast yet...

00:05:26.000 --> 00:05:28.350
Even though the dorm supervisor gave me some sweets...

00:05:28.350 --> 00:05:32.430
I should finish this quickly, then eat both of them together.

00:05:34.980 --> 00:05:37.720
Hurry up and get big~

00:05:37.720 --> 00:05:39.220
Hey, you poured too much!

00:05:39.250 --> 00:05:39.790
Eh?

00:05:39.790 --> 00:05:40.820
If you do that...

00:05:51.510 --> 00:05:54.100
Geez, just because you wanted to eat it sooner,

00:05:54.100 --> 00:05:57.820
you randomly added the batter... What's with your mind?

00:05:57.820 --> 00:06:00.260
This isn't the growth rings of the tree, but the bark of the tree.

00:06:00.610 --> 00:06:03.230
Well, well, everyone makes mistakes.

00:06:03.230 --> 00:06:07.040
I sympathize with her. She didn't have breakfast because she overslept...

00:06:07.040 --> 00:06:10.240
It's impossible to have Ichigo make sweets on an empty stomach.

00:06:10.240 --> 00:06:11.710
Geez, it seems so.

00:06:11.710 --> 00:06:15.140
A-ny-way, whose fault is it that I overslept, I wonder!?

00:06:16.630 --> 00:06:18.260
Wait!

00:06:18.260 --> 00:06:19.810
Stop right there!

00:06:21.060 --> 00:06:22.500
Morning, Ichigo-chan!

00:06:22.500 --> 00:06:23.360
Eh? Rumi-san?

00:06:23.810 --> 00:06:29.160
I'm sorry. I had to wake up early because it's my turn this week to prepare the ingredients, so I couldn't wake you up.

00:06:29.160 --> 00:06:32.660
Ah, it's okay. The dorm supervisor gave me some sweets.

00:06:33.150 --> 00:06:34.680
I'll be back in action after eating it.

00:06:37.090 --> 00:06:38.370
That's Baumkuchen, isn't it?

00:06:38.750 --> 00:06:41.080
The growth rings are layered properly and beautifully.

00:06:41.080 --> 00:06:41.880
Yeah.

00:06:43.740 --> 00:06:45.030
Delicious!

00:06:45.030 --> 00:06:50.190
It feels moist and has a deep flavour that is different from cakes at normal shops that have a dry taste.

00:06:50.190 --> 00:06:53.300
Also, it seems like it can really cheer people up.

00:06:53.800 --> 00:06:55.480
Let us taste it too.

00:07:01.220 --> 00:07:03.240
Seriously, this is really delicious.

00:07:03.590 --> 00:07:05.910
This is definitely the dorm supervisor's homemade sweets, isn't it?

00:07:06.450 --> 00:07:08.010
Eh? Homemade?

00:07:08.010 --> 00:07:10.910
That's right. You and the guys don't know about this though.

00:07:11.510 --> 00:07:19.950
Every year, the new students who come to the girls' dorms will be lavished with "welcome sweets" which the dorm supervisor made.

00:07:19.950 --> 00:07:27.630
It's simply the best! It even motivated everyone to learn to be able to make such sweets!

00:07:28.080 --> 00:07:31.070
I see. I transfered to this academy in the middle of the school term.

00:07:31.070 --> 00:07:35.590
How nice. Both dorm supervisors are a married couple but the one in the boys' dorm doesn't do that.

00:07:35.590 --> 00:07:40.090
Eh? A married couple? The boys' and girls' dorm supervisors?

00:07:40.090 --> 00:07:46.090
You didn't know about it? Look, there's a log house in the forest beside the dorms, right?

00:07:46.090 --> 00:07:48.490
When you mention it, there is...

00:07:48.490 --> 00:07:50.360
The two of them are living there.

00:07:50.920 --> 00:07:55.580
But how did she make them? It doesn't look like she used an oven specially for Baumkuchen...

00:07:56.100 --> 00:07:58.240
So she made it using a frying pan?

00:07:58.240 --> 00:08:00.730
She would need to be very skilled to do that.

00:08:00.730 --> 00:08:01.770
That's true.

00:08:02.710 --> 00:08:07.140
Then, how about after school, we'll all go and ask them how she made it?

00:08:07.140 --> 00:08:09.320
Are you serious about that?

00:08:09.320 --> 00:08:13.320
The girls' dorm supervisor is well-known for being very scary if she blows her top.

00:08:13.320 --> 00:08:17.640
The last time when I handed in the letter of absence for you, she had her eyes staring at me.

00:08:18.610 --> 00:08:21.680
That's fine, it doesn't concern me.

00:08:21.680 --> 00:08:24.910
Because I'm always getting scolded, so I'm used to it anyway.

00:08:26.610 --> 00:08:28.190
Please excuse us!

00:08:29.840 --> 00:08:31.370
They aren't in?

00:08:31.370 --> 00:08:32.770
Are they at the dorms?

00:08:32.770 --> 00:08:36.170
What are you saying? You damn person...

00:08:39.250 --> 00:08:41.080
Dorm supervisor... Umm...

00:08:41.620 --> 00:08:43.290
Sorry, I'm in the middle of moving out of the house now.

00:08:43.750 --> 00:08:46.370
Wait a minute, Harue. Listen to what I have to say.

00:08:46.370 --> 00:08:49.680
I don't want to hear it. We have nothing more to talk about.

00:08:49.680 --> 00:08:51.170
Like I said, why are you...

00:08:51.170 --> 00:08:53.720
That person is the boys' dorm supervisor, right?

00:08:51.170 --> 00:08:53.720
P-Please wait.

00:08:53.720 --> 00:08:57.380
This seems to be a married couple's quarrel?

00:08:59.610 --> 00:09:00.470
I must stop them!

00:09:00.470 --> 00:09:01.890
Hey, forget it.

00:09:01.890 --> 00:09:05.020
People say "One should not interfere in lovers' quarrels" though...

00:09:05.010 --> 00:09:07.310
No matter what you say now, it's futile.

00:09:07.310 --> 00:09:09.690
I've already decided that I'm moving out.

00:09:09.690 --> 00:09:12.000
Moving out? Where are you going?

00:09:12.000 --> 00:09:13.960
Isn't that obvious? The girls' dorm.

00:09:13.960 --> 00:09:17.450
Girls' dorm? The one for middle schoolers?

00:09:17.450 --> 00:09:20.280
Dorm supervisors couple's house

00:09:18.450 --> 00:09:20.280
Middle school dormitory

00:09:20.700 --> 00:09:23.000
That's pretty close...

00:09:23.000 --> 00:09:24.040
Yeah...

00:09:35.130 --> 00:09:38.790
Umm... What happened to cause the situation just now?

00:09:38.790 --> 00:09:42.220
Well, it's an embarrassing story...

00:09:42.220 --> 00:09:49.190
The truth is that my son persuaded us to retire and leave here, and live together with his family.

00:09:49.200 --> 00:09:51.160
My wife is against the idea.

00:09:52.030 --> 00:09:53.620
So then...

00:09:53.610 --> 00:09:58.700
As you can see. My wife can't bare leaving this academy.

00:09:59.060 --> 00:10:02.350
So, she's moving to the girls' dorm?

00:10:02.350 --> 00:10:04.370
That's because boys are forbidden in there.

00:10:05.310 --> 00:10:08.920
I guess my wife will live there until I decide to change my standing on the idea.

00:10:09.290 --> 00:10:10.370
I-I see.

00:10:10.920 --> 00:10:16.070
But... My wife didn't say why she's against it.

00:10:16.050 --> 00:10:19.130
If I knew the answer, it'd be easier to discuss the matter with her.

00:10:19.590 --> 00:10:20.640
If it's just that...

00:10:20.900 --> 00:10:21.630
Amano-san.

00:10:23.010 --> 00:10:24.140
Huh?

00:10:29.240 --> 00:10:30.510
Good luck!

00:10:30.890 --> 00:10:35.290
That's right... Since I'm the only girl who can listen to her answer...

00:10:35.290 --> 00:10:38.430
Do your best, Ichigo! We will be supporting you from the back!

00:10:38.430 --> 00:10:40.790
If we can do anything to help, let us know.

00:10:40.790 --> 00:10:44.610
Beyond this point, boys are forbidden. It's a flower garden of the maiden.

00:10:45.090 --> 00:10:47.080
Cafe-kun has to wait outside.

00:10:47.510 --> 00:10:51.460
But that's for guys... I'm a Spirit, you know?

00:10:51.460 --> 00:10:53.050
Not a chance!

00:10:56.310 --> 00:10:57.620
Yes?

00:10:58.130 --> 00:10:59.140
Excuse me for intruding.

00:10:59.140 --> 00:11:01.130
Ah, can you help me out a bit?

00:11:01.560 --> 00:11:02.700
Y-Yes.

00:11:09.640 --> 00:11:10.770
A-Amano-san...

00:11:11.190 --> 00:11:13.780
I-I'm used to it...

00:11:14.270 --> 00:11:17.190
You want to ask why I'm so obstinate about leaving the academy?

00:11:17.190 --> 00:11:24.750
Yes. Even if I might be peering too much, I'm really worried about dorm supervisor.

00:11:25.470 --> 00:11:27.000
Let's see...

00:11:28.000 --> 00:11:34.000
I had a clumsy and hopeless student like you, making me worry all day to the point where I couldn't quit working here...

00:11:34.580 --> 00:11:35.840
T-That's...

00:11:35.840 --> 00:11:39.920
Like today, when you were running in the hallway, you fell down the staircase.

00:11:40.970 --> 00:11:43.840
Also, you ran away from the dorms without permission not long after you transferred.

00:11:43.850 --> 00:11:48.020
And then your friend helped you by handing in a letter of absence on your behalf.

00:11:48.540 --> 00:11:50.520
Ah, this means that I was found out long ago?

00:11:50.520 --> 00:11:52.880
I can tell by looking at your face.

00:11:52.880 --> 00:11:56.440
Well, you came back quickly after that. So I didn't speak of the matter.

00:11:56.440 --> 00:11:59.950
Even more, the last year's New Year's Eve, we were waiting for you but you didn't come.

00:11:59.950 --> 00:12:01.450
The noodles turned soggy.

00:12:01.980 --> 00:12:04.330
I'm sorry for everything.

00:12:04.330 --> 00:12:06.040
I'm joking, I'm joking.

00:12:12.960 --> 00:12:14.060
This is?

00:12:14.060 --> 00:12:16.000
This is a photograph that was taken when I graduated.

00:12:16.000 --> 00:12:18.550
Ah! That's the boys' dorm supervisor, isn't it?

00:12:19.080 --> 00:12:20.670
He's so young!

00:12:22.560 --> 00:12:26.060
But you said it was taken when you graduated... could it be?

00:12:26.060 --> 00:12:28.620
Yes. There's another youngster there, right?

00:12:31.140 --> 00:12:33.650
That was me when I graduated.

00:12:34.090 --> 00:12:35.160
Eh?

00:12:36.100 --> 00:12:40.150
Back then, there were a lot of boys who wanted to become pâtissiers.

00:12:40.760 --> 00:12:45.680
And there were no dorms other than the boys', so I could only come to school from my distant home.

00:12:46.450 --> 00:12:51.490
There was a time when I was too engrossed in making sweets so I missed the last bus.

00:12:51.490 --> 00:12:56.880
At that time, by a mere coincidence, a guy driving a car came and gave me lift back home.

00:12:57.620 --> 00:13:01.890
To show my gratitue, I thought of making Baumkuchen for him as I heard he liked it...

00:13:02.510 --> 00:13:06.240
But at that time, girls were forbidden there, I couldn't even get close.

00:13:07.050 --> 00:13:10.970
On top of that, he didn't leave the dorms.

00:13:10.970 --> 00:13:15.560
I don't know how many times I continued that, but I still couldn't give it. I could only turn back home.

00:13:15.570 --> 00:13:25.570
But, you know, when I saw his working form, and the excitement that he had with other dorm students, I was unknowingly charmed by him.

00:13:26.570 --> 00:13:31.280
I didn't know how I should have expressed this feeling to him, so I kept coming back to that person's area...

00:13:31.280 --> 00:13:36.370
I couldn't express my feelings at all, up until graduation.

00:13:33.780 --> 00:13:37.290
Out of Academy

00:13:33.780 --> 00:13:37.290
Girls' dorm opening next spring

00:13:33.780 --> 00:13:37.290
Hardball baseball club

00:13:36.370 --> 00:13:39.920
When I knew that there would be a girls' dorm the year after,

00:13:39.920 --> 00:13:43.510
I thought "I have to do this!" and so I went to apply for the position of the dorm supervisor.

00:13:44.090 --> 00:13:46.510
So then your goal of being a pâtissière was...

00:13:46.510 --> 00:13:52.510
Yeah, he was surprised too. But after that, I was finally able to express my feelings to him.

00:13:53.720 --> 00:13:55.550
I don't have to become a professional.

00:13:55.550 --> 00:14:02.580
I just want to be able to share the sweets I made with you and the students.

00:14:02.580 --> 00:14:05.680
That's my happiness, you know?

00:14:07.580 --> 00:14:09.240
We worked very hard after that.

00:14:21.100 --> 00:14:22.970
Is that your brilliant confession?

00:14:23.340 --> 00:14:27.130
But you know, when we discussed about leaving the dorms just now...

00:14:28.720 --> 00:14:32.350
Darling. Look at this. Does it bring back any memories?

00:14:39.670 --> 00:14:42.280
Hmm... It might be better if it's less bitter.

00:14:42.670 --> 00:14:46.220
That guy, he totally forgot everything that happened in the past.

00:14:46.220 --> 00:14:48.220
I-I see.

00:14:48.190 --> 00:14:51.200
I'm really happy about my son asking us to live together with him.

00:14:51.200 --> 00:14:54.240
But I also treasure the life here.

00:14:54.240 --> 00:14:57.290
Yet that guy... It really annoys me!

00:14:59.450 --> 00:15:05.050
Dorm supervisor. Umm, the Baumkuchen you gave me this morning was really delicious. It really cheered me up.

00:15:05.400 --> 00:15:08.630
Really? Hearing you say that makes me happy.

00:15:08.630 --> 00:15:11.640
It was filled with lots of dorm supervisor's feelings.

00:15:11.630 --> 00:15:16.810
If you express the feelings of making sweets for everyone's sake to your husband...

00:15:17.600 --> 00:15:19.350
Even if I did tell him...

00:15:19.810 --> 00:15:25.480
So, if you make the sweets filled with feelings, you will be able to express those feelings to him...

00:15:26.770 --> 00:15:29.780
This might just be a childish point of view...

00:15:31.960 --> 00:15:33.260
I see.

00:15:34.200 --> 00:15:36.870
Express through words, it will only spark off more arguments.

00:15:36.870 --> 00:15:40.200
In other words, it's better to express with sweets, right?

00:15:40.210 --> 00:15:40.910
Yes.

00:15:41.380 --> 00:15:43.790
That's true. It sounds interesting.

00:15:44.930 --> 00:15:46.620
Shall we try it?

00:15:46.620 --> 00:15:51.090
Ah, but there are no ingredients here, and I can't go back home...

00:15:51.470 --> 00:15:55.760
That's fine. Your husband's outside now, we can take this chance...

00:15:55.770 --> 00:15:57.170
Yes, yes.

00:16:10.060 --> 00:16:13.240
By the way, how do you make the handmade Baumkuchen?

00:16:13.980 --> 00:16:15.240
First of all, this.

00:16:15.850 --> 00:16:19.910
You roll together the aluminum foil like a rod.

00:16:19.910 --> 00:16:23.450
Ensure that the length fits into the frying pan.

00:16:24.820 --> 00:16:27.470
Then brush the surface of the rod with olive oil.

00:16:29.810 --> 00:16:31.500
That's all for the tools.

00:16:31.500 --> 00:16:32.680
That's it?

00:16:32.680 --> 00:16:34.680
Yes. Now let's begin shall we?

00:16:38.620 --> 00:16:42.880
After pouring in the batter, slowly move the frying pan to spread the batter evenly.

00:16:42.880 --> 00:16:48.360
When it's cooked, you put the aluminum foil here, and use the slice to roll it up.

00:16:49.030 --> 00:16:50.860
Ah! It rolled out beautifully.

00:16:51.300 --> 00:16:56.570
Master this, you will be able to make bite-sized Baumkuchen with beautiful rings.

00:16:57.150 --> 00:16:59.310
This is a secret tip after much experience.

00:17:02.370 --> 00:17:07.180
That's amazing. I can't do it well even with using the special tools.

00:17:07.180 --> 00:17:09.870
You screwed up using the special oven?

00:17:09.880 --> 00:17:14.050
I was too hungry so I accidentally poured too much batter onto it.

00:17:14.590 --> 00:17:17.590
You can't do that. I think you know the answer.

00:17:17.580 --> 00:17:21.900
When making sweets, you must keep in mind that it's made for others to eat.

00:17:22.530 --> 00:17:24.330
"Made for others to eat."

00:17:24.330 --> 00:17:29.560
For example, "I'm going to give this to the late girl that skipped breakfast"...

00:17:29.560 --> 00:17:32.730
And to encourage new students.

00:17:33.390 --> 00:17:38.460
At that time, you will think of those who wants to eat your sweets, from your heart.

00:17:43.450 --> 00:17:49.170
That's right. Even back then, he's a person that I wanted to eat the best sweets I could make.

00:17:49.700 --> 00:17:51.170
Dorm supervisor?

00:17:52.300 --> 00:17:55.590
I know now. I'll definitely be able to express my feelings.

00:17:57.180 --> 00:18:00.890
She's slow. Aren't they done talking yet?

00:18:00.890 --> 00:18:03.600
It can't be helped. I'll give up for today.

00:18:04.160 --> 00:18:05.240
Thanks for waiting.

00:18:06.550 --> 00:18:07.610
Harue?

00:18:08.230 --> 00:18:10.060
This is really well-made.

00:18:10.060 --> 00:18:11.830
Ichigo did really well.

00:18:11.830 --> 00:18:13.620
Let's hope they make up.

00:18:16.210 --> 00:18:17.820
Magical macaron!

00:18:18.860 --> 00:18:19.490
Sweets!

00:18:19.490 --> 00:18:20.190
Romance!

00:18:20.190 --> 00:18:21.400
Card!

00:18:21.400 --> 00:18:23.630
Come out!

00:18:34.490 --> 00:18:36.240
So this is your answer.

00:18:38.590 --> 00:18:41.220
Please don't speak, just eat it.

00:18:44.640 --> 00:18:46.440
I get it. I get it.

00:18:55.010 --> 00:18:56.630
It's different from the one this morning...

00:18:56.630 --> 00:18:57.110
Yeah.

00:18:57.570 --> 00:19:00.760
The cooking perfectly matches my preference for bitterness.

00:19:01.560 --> 00:19:07.320
Today's argument had both its sweet and bitter moments. Let's forgive and forget those feelings.

00:19:07.320 --> 00:19:09.160
Ah! As expected from a married couple.

00:19:09.160 --> 00:19:11.840
This Baumkuchen's message...

00:19:11.840 --> 00:19:13.650
...has been fully delivered.

00:19:13.650 --> 00:19:15.670
You three should mind your own business!

00:19:16.080 --> 00:19:17.670
That's not it...

00:19:17.970 --> 00:19:19.230
I get it.

00:19:19.230 --> 00:19:21.890
No, you don't get it at all.

00:19:22.320 --> 00:19:23.860
Why is he such a dumb person?

00:19:23.860 --> 00:19:25.350
Yeah, really.

00:19:25.350 --> 00:19:26.770
What a problematic person.

00:19:27.210 --> 00:19:31.770
U-Umm, it seems there was a mistake, can you take another bite please?

00:19:32.210 --> 00:19:34.260
Eh? Another bite?

00:19:40.620 --> 00:19:41.710
What's the matter?

00:19:41.710 --> 00:19:43.910
Delicious. It's really delicious.

00:19:46.360 --> 00:19:49.820
You, really... I can't take it anymore.

00:19:49.820 --> 00:19:51.290
I should just move out!

00:19:51.890 --> 00:19:53.550
Harue, wait a minute.

00:19:53.550 --> 00:19:57.470
U-Umm, please look at this. I think it might give you a hint.

00:20:02.840 --> 00:20:03.830
I knew it...

00:20:04.220 --> 00:20:04.790
Eh?

00:20:05.260 --> 00:20:13.390
When I was young, I preferred a sweet taste. And you knew that, and gave me a sweet Baumkuchen that you made as a present for me.

00:20:13.400 --> 00:20:16.360
My taste has changed along with my age...

00:20:17.520 --> 00:20:21.990
The feelings both I and the students have towards you, remain the same.

00:20:22.640 --> 00:20:29.010
"I always wanted to let the students here taste the sweets you made."

00:20:29.010 --> 00:20:31.150
That's your happiness.

00:20:32.910 --> 00:20:35.080
That's the reason why you don't want to leave this place.

00:20:35.520 --> 00:20:36.830
Darling...

00:20:36.830 --> 00:20:39.800
That's why, I understood it after tasting the sweets.

00:20:40.530 --> 00:20:42.510
Let's continue the work of ours together.

00:20:45.590 --> 00:20:47.680
Is it okay? Really?

00:20:48.090 --> 00:20:55.060
Yeah. Just like this Baumkuchen, we will engrave our rings onto the academy.

00:20:59.400 --> 00:21:00.390
I'm late!

00:20:59.690 --> 00:21:00.990
Hurry, hurry!

00:21:04.590 --> 00:21:06.610
Amano-san, you again...

00:21:07.070 --> 00:21:09.620
Ah, dorm supervisor. Good morning.

00:21:10.110 --> 00:21:12.330
Really, you're a weird person...

00:21:13.300 --> 00:21:15.480
Amano-san, sit down here for a minute.

00:21:15.480 --> 00:21:19.920
Get it? To make good sweets, you must follow the...

00:21:15.480 --> 00:21:17.720
My classes are going to start!

00:21:17.720 --> 00:21:19.920
It isn't Vanilla's fault this time, you know?

